 * pending. This can genuinely take up to ~180s for a plugin-heavy preset (see
 * FREEMC_PLUGIN_READY_TIMEOUT_MS in lib/free-minecraft-control.ts) — without
 * this, the button just said "Creating…" and the page otherwise looked frozen
 * for that whole window, which reads as broken rather than working. The
 * messages below are deliberately generic/sequential, not tied to a real
 * server-reported step — the action is one blocking call with no progress
 * stream, so claiming precise live status would be dishonest. They're framed
